          <li><span class="ex">The speaker arrives at FIVE THIRty, doesn’t she?</span> Use a falling voice through the tag.</li>
          <li><span class="ex">You haven’t sent the WI-FI code, have you?</span> Use a rising voice through the tag.</li>
          <li><span class="ex">You have the ROOM key, don’t you?</span> Link <span class="ex">don’t you</span> naturally.</li>
          <li><span class="ex">You haven’t sent it, have you? No, I HAVEN’T.</span></li>
          <li><span class="ex">I said he HAS arrived, HASN’T he?</span></li>
