  <h2>Notice and repair the tag or response</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="doesnt" data-hint="The statement already uses be: is ready." data-fix="Lena is ready, isn’t she?" data-why="Echo the statement’s operator is; do not supply does when be is already present." data-success-message="Correct. Isn’t she echoes is and reverses its polarity.">
