    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="They’ve received the code, haven’t they?" data-hint="They’ve means they have before participle received, so echo negative haven’t." data-fix="They’ve received the code, haven’t they?"><p class="quiz-question">1. Which sentence accurately tags a positive Present Perfect statement?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="They’ve received the code, haven’t they?">They’ve received the code, haven’t they?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="They’ve received the code, don’t they?">They’ve received the code, don’t they?</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="They’ve received the code, have the guests?">They’ve received the code, have the guests?</button></div></div>
