  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Next-day operator, negative-meaning polarity, and response-truth retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <p>Return without rereading the page. Identify the statement operator, semantic polarity, and real subject reference before building each tag or interpreting the answer.</p>
    <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You retained U.S. lexical-have do-support, positive tagging after never, and statement-based response logic.">
      <h3>Three delayed checks</h3>
